<div class="privacy-overlay" id="privacy-overlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <div class="privacy-modal">
        <div class="privacy-header">
            <h2 id="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h2>
            <button class="privacy-close" id="privacy-close" aria-label="Close privacy policy">✕ CLOSE</button>
        </div>
        <div class="privacy-body">
            <h3>Overview</h3>
            <p>Build My Club ("we", "us", "our") is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights in relation to it.</p>

            <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
            <p>When you register an account, we collect your email address and a password (stored as a secure hash). We do not collect your name, phone number, or payment information.</p>
            <p>During normal gameplay, your save data is stored locally on your device. If you choose to sync your progress, we receive aggregate gameplay statistics (such as your club's reputation and career earnings) to maintain leaderboard rankings.</p>

            <h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
            <p>Your email address is used solely to authenticate your account and, if you opt in, to send you updates about the game. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
            <p>Gameplay sync data is used exclusively to calculate and display global leaderboard rankings. We retain sync records to detect and prevent cheating.</p>

            <h3>Data Storage & Security</h3>
            <p>Your data is stored on secured servers. Passwords are hashed using industry-standard algorithms and are never stored in plain text. We use HTTPS for all data in transit.</p>

            <h3>Data Retention</h3>
            <p>We retain your account data for as long as your account is active. You may request deletion of your account and all associated data at any time by contacting us.</p>

            <h3>Third-Party Services</h3>
            <p>The game is offline-first and does not integrate third-party advertising or analytics SDKs. This website uses Google Fonts, which may set cookies in accordance with Google's own privacy policy.</p>

            <h3>Your Rights</h3>
            <p>Depending on where you are located, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete the personal data we hold about you. To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at the address below.</p>

            <h3>Changes to This Policy</h3>
            <p>We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the date at the bottom of this page. Continued use of the game or this website after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="privacy-footer">
